- **FAIL — process remains alive through Restart:** not observed.
- **FAIL — Scheduled Task remains present/Ready through Restart:** not observed; task absent.
- **FAIL — fresh session ID is strictly greater:** no live session ID was available.
- **FAIL — Restart completes within 10 seconds:** no Start/Ack transition occurred.

No unit mock, fake task, stale cached log, synthetic Ack, synthetic session ID, or test-only
substitution was used. No task was created, no binary was installed, no firewall rule changed,
no user was logged out, and the remote service was not rebuilt, installed, restarted, or
